OL,3,AMan admits murder of woman missing for
OL,4,A28 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded guilty to the murder
OL,7,Fof a woman who went missing 28 years
OL,8,Fago.
OL,10,FPatricia Lashley, who was 33 at the
OL,11,Ftime, was last seen near her home on
OL,12,FHall Street, Dudley, in September 1998.
OL,14,FTrevor Dunkley, 66, pleaded guilty to
OL,15,Fher murder and a separate count of
OL,16,Fpreventing her lawful burial at a
OL,17,Fhearing at Wolverhampton Crown Court on
OL,18,FFriday.
OL,20,FHe was remanded in custody and will be
OL,21,Fsentenced at the same court on 6
OL,22,FNovember.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
